{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣資深歌手庾澄慶剛剛在北京完成《整晚哈音樂》，他在演唱會中以《情非得已》、《讓我一次愛個夠》等曲目引發全場合唱，更邀得A-Lin作為嘉賓登台合作《失戀無罪》，令歌迷歡喜若狂。</p><p>不過，原定11月14日的廣州站卻突然宣布因故延期，歌迷感到相當意</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:04:33.184374+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:06:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.279590+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:59:01.279590+00:00","content_hash":"4ebe6ed84b432a724013ebb44660496513eeff6f85e144f908a23b51b6955f2a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}